#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:8 08328be95262478dab34384a2dc2c37d
msgid "ZED stereo camera for Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "ZED 立体相机用于无 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:12 8d9b5b01daf646faaaff932cae11289c
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `ZED stereo camera "
"<https://www.stereolabs.com>`__ can be used with `OpenKai "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI>`__ as a substitute for a GPS allowing"
" position control modes like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将 `ZED 立体相机 <https://www.stereolabs.com>`__ 与 `OpenKai "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI>`__ 配合使用，作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而支持 "
"Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:18 a12da6613ed64dd48dc465f169f802bc
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:20 d9b8f3b5e6d94818bbf52f157c19b606
msgid "`Stereo Labs ZED camera <https://store.stereolabs.com/products/zed>`__"
msgstr "`Stereo Labs ZED 相机 <https://store.stereolabs.com/products/zed>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:21 fa00165592b642a7b4b0264e296c940e
msgid ""
"`NVidia TX1 <https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/autonomous-machines/embedded-"
"systems-dev-kits-modules/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`NVidia TX1 <https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/autonomous-machines/embedded-"
"systems-dev-kits-modules/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:22 0234d83971ec47cb8c3210eaf8f77fea
msgid "`Auvidea J120 carrier board <https://auvidea.com/j120/>`__"
msgstr "`Auvidea J120 载板 <https://auvidea.com/j120/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:25 8084564d4df849b39ecbccc3bb65f242
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:27 afbf97c751e34594a4ce0b1e9c4e1c7a
msgid ""
"connect the autopilot and TX1 as shown on the `NVidia TX1 as a Companion "
"Computer <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-"
"tx1.html>`__ wiki page"
msgstr ""
"按照 `NVidia TX1 作为伴飞计算机 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx1.html>`__ Wiki 页面所示，连接飞控与 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:28 ff1ed304fb1b4ab2bde39d6dc01e5a8a
msgid ""
"flash the TX1 as described in the `Setup the TX1 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.html#setup-"
"the-tx1>`__ section of the above wiki page but use the apsync-tx1-openkai "
"image from `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta/>`__"
msgstr ""
"按照上述 Wiki 页面 `设置 TX1 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx1.html#setup-the-tx1>`__ 章节的说明刷写 TX1，但请使用来自 `firmware.ardupilot.org"
" <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta/>`__ 的 apsync-"
"tx1-openkai 镜像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:29 a98b8e0ac0004c29a4927d4882058595
msgid ""
"mount the ZED camera upside-down and using vibration dampeners to the front "
"of the vehicle. It can be mounted right-side-up after `connecting with ssh "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/apsync-intro.html#connecting-with-ssh>`__ "
"and then modify `~/src/OpenKAI/kiss/apmCopter.kiss "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI/blob/master/kiss/apmCopter.kiss#L60>`__"
" so \"bFlip\" is `1`."
msgstr ""
"将 ZED 相机倒置并通过减震器安装在飞行器前方。也可以正面朝上安装，`通过 SSH 连接 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/apsync-intro.html#connecting-with-ssh>`__ "
"后，修改 `~/src/OpenKAI/kiss/apmCopter.kiss "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI/blob/master/kiss/apmCopter.kiss#L60>`__，将"
" 「bFlip」 设置为 `1`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:31 84294c87bed94d35b57b505c06e3d0da
msgid ""
"in order to download the ZED camera's calibration parameters from "
"stereolabs.com, connect the TX1 to the Internet with an Ethernet cable "
"during powerup (this procedure is only required once)"
msgstr "为从 stereolabs.com 下载 ZED 相机的校准参数，开机时请通过网线将 TX1 连接到互联网（此步骤仅需操作一次）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:32 8c1950441c9b4f6aa09cb05cae97d62d
msgid ""
"disable APSync's video streaming (so that OpenKai can use the camera) by "
"connecting your computer to APSync's access point (``ssid=ardupilot``, "
"pw=ardupilot), then open a browser to ``http://10.0.1.128:8000`` and click "
"the red **Disable Auto Streaming** button (button should turn green) and "
"reboot the TX1."
msgstr ""
"禁用 APSync 的视频流（以便 OpenKai 使用相机）：将计算机连接至 APSync "
"的接入点（``ssid=ardupilot``，密码=ardupilot），打开浏览器访问 "
"``http://10.0.1.128:8000``，点击红色 **Disable Auto Streaming** 按钮（按钮应变为绿色），然后重启 "
"TX1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:40 b5ec489b50e34c139079e2e4ec36a585
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站进行配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:41 89366d2c3fa14e599971d141e0225118
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下是第一个近距离传感器的示例设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:43 5545c52bd7b149b5b87fc7b94e16c8c8
msgid ""
"enable communication between the TX1 and autopilot using the `Setup the "
"Pixhawk instructions from the tx1 setup wiki page "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.html#setup-"
"the-pixhawk>`__"
msgstr ""
"按照 `TX1 设置 Wiki 页面中的 Setup the Pixhawk 说明 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.html#setup-"
"the-pixhawk>`__ 启用 TX1 与飞控之间的通信"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:44 bb0292dd1a804b0c86239ca68e2beb26
msgid "set :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` to 3 (means use EKF3)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设置为 3（使用 EKF3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:45 2d837c49384c441c8c8e2184e3875d75
msgid "set :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` to 0 (disable EKF2)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` 设置为 0（禁用 EKF2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:46 6cbc4c87aa7747ee99519846ebe20d27
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` to 1 (enable EKF3)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` 设置为 1（启用 EKF3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:47 73cf8d145cbc440481280030b054b862
msgid "set :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` to 0 (disable the GPS)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` 设置为 0（禁用 GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:48 4b1b9d0b58d6475d98aa9c7bdd2f35b7
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` to 1 (enable visual odometry)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` 设置为 1（启用视觉里程计）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:49 94fff2b097c24c76b4af6870c50a5b2c
msgid ""
"optionally set :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` to 2 (enable using ZED's depth "
"map for object avoidance)"
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` 设置为 2（启用 ZED 深度图用于避障）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:51 f5746e817c5944aea49f1dcd043e7199
msgid "Optionally you may also:"
msgstr "您还可以选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:53 f5fd03de4cc64b6cbae06770c4b68e28
msgid ""
"set the :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Y  <VISO_POS_Y>` and "
":ref:`VISO_POS_Z  <VISO_POS_Z>` to account for the camera's offset from the "
"IMU or vehicle's center-of-gravity (:ref:`more details here <common-sensor-"
"offset-compensation>`)"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`、:ref:`VISO_POS_Y  <VISO_POS_Y>` 和 "
":ref:`VISO_POS_Z  <VISO_POS_Z>` 以补偿相机相对于 IMU 或飞行器重心的偏移（:ref:`详见此处 <common-"
"sensor-offset-compensation>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:54 ba9717bdb8864d20a684084eb1d58a83
msgid ""
"mount the camera in other orientations and change the :ref:`VISO_ORIENT "
"<VISO_ORIENT>` parameter. Note: if you are using the ZED's depth sensing you"
" will also need to modify `OpenKai's configuration "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI/blob/master/kiss/apmCopter.kiss>`__  "
"(not documented)"
msgstr ""
"将相机安装在其他方向并更改 :ref:`VISO_ORIENT <VISO_ORIENT>` 参数。注意：若使用 ZED 的深度传感功能，还需修改 "
"`OpenKai 配置 "
"<https://github.com/yankailab/OpenKAI/blob/master/kiss/apmCopter.kiss>`__（暂无文档说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:58 60264be0405b4864b6f8444b2f3393d8
msgid "Ground Testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:60 2ad74c9445214168b7eb0ad5d192abff
msgid ""
"Plug in the vehicle's LiPo battery so that both the TX1 and autopilot are "
"powered"
msgstr "接通飞行器的锂电池，为 TX1 和飞控供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:61 b25b9f87b985484383da3f6627f2111a
msgid "Connect the autopilot to a ground station using a USB cable"
msgstr "通过 USB 线将飞控连接到地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:62 b14191f31d3848528502876cdb4e4f51
msgid ""
"If you are using Mission Planner as your ground station, once messages are "
"successfully passing from the ZED/TX1 to the autopilot: - a proximity viewer"
" should appear showing the distance to objects ahead of the vehicle (if "
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` was enabled above) - \"Bad Vision Position\" "
"message should disappear from the HUD"
msgstr ""
"若使用 Mission Planner 作为地面站，当 ZED/TX1 到飞控的消息传递成功后：- "
"应出现近距离查看器，显示飞行器前方的障碍物距离（如已启用 :ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>`）；- HUD 中的 「Bad "
"Vision Position」 消息应消失"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:65 e49514557649451594a78dfa907420c7
msgid ""
"Set the home position from the ground station map (from MP's Flight Data "
"screen, right-mouse-button-click on the map and select \"Set EKF Origin "
"Here\").  The vehicle should appear on the map."
msgstr ""
"在地面站地图上设置 Home 位置（在 MP 飞行数据界面，右键点击地图并选择 「Set EKF Origin Here」）。飞行器应出现在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:70 7fc639889d774f77978b1c5f9bb2c031
msgid ""
"Pick-up the vehicle and walk it around checking that the vehicle's position "
"movements are shown on the map"
msgstr "拿起飞行器四处走动，检查飞行器的位置变化是否在地图上正确显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:73 679d6be29d414412bcc4e9b0cfefe5b8
msgid "Flight testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:75 d4770f8a352d4522b2f4a27decfabdab
msgid "Setup the vehicle with AltHold and Loiter flight modes"
msgstr "将飞行器设置为 AltHold 和 Loiter 飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:76 03d5888a6c6b4fac93484a3ec9c676f2
msgid ""
"Setup an :ref:`auxiliary switch <channel-7-and-8-options>` to enable/disable"
" object avoidance and move switch to the off position.  Alternatively set "
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` to 0.  This helps ensure the vehicle will not "
"backaway from objects in AltHold mode which could surprise the pilot."
msgstr ""
"设置一个 :ref:`辅助开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` 以启用/禁用避障，并将开关拨到关闭位置。或将 "
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` 设置为 0。这样可避免飞行器在 AltHold 模式下因障碍物而后退，以免让飞手感到意外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:77 89189e0a335c4611b6118b4f778b86fd
msgid "Attempt to arm and take-off in Loiter mode"
msgstr "尝试在 Loiter 模式下解锁并起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:80 f3b9c4964fec4d648e0056558d7c7f5a
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:82 e3c7e8e8f21748fb9e0d2cbd72395769
msgid ""
"The ZED's visual odometry information will appear in the VISO dataflash log "
"messages."
msgstr "ZED 的视觉里程计信息将记录在 VISO DataFlash 日志消息中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:83 e794765e2f6740e481d3e49d13aa7c2a
msgid ""
"Distance to objects ahead of the vehicle will appear in the PRX messages."
msgstr "飞行器前方的障碍物距离将记录在 PRX 消息中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-zed.rst:84 44e76d688ccb49639748350d4abfeb60
msgid "EKF's visual odometry information will appear in XKFD messages"
msgstr "EKF 的视觉里程计信息将记录在 XKFD 消息中"
